{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Don't Crush: Death Counter Adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multiplayer platformer designed for friends who love to mess with each other! Every death is a test of friendship, and dying isn't the end - it's the beginning of social embarrassment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Precision Jumping Challenge: Advanced double-jump mechanics with wall-bouncing techniques</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Multiplayer Trolling System: Real-time death counter that exposes every &quot;useless teammate&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Infinite Revival Mechanic: 1-second respawn with no penalties, but death count is permanently recorded</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Cross-Platform Multiplayer: Steam and Epic Games Store players can play together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Game Highlights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 30+ creative levels with unique challenges and traps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unlock &quot;Useless Teammate Badge&quot; after 100 deaths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Support for 2 players in multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Real-time voice chat for maximum trolling fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Perfect For</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Plastic Friendship: Friends who pretend to cooperate but secretly compete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Hardcore Players: Those seeking no-damage speedrun challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Social Anxiety Relief: Building friendships through mutual trolling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Being bad at games isn't scary - what's scary is who dies more!&quot; Ready for the ultimate test of friendship?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Technical Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Built with Unreal Engine 5.5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Cross-platform multiplayer support (Steam + Epic Games Store)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Optimized network synchronization for smooth multiplayer experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Available on Windows and Android platforms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the death counter carnival and see who's the real &quot;team IQ ceiling&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"JUST GETTING START","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054290/b458316b248efeeece9b5498af42356d7a36b4cb.jpg"},{"name":"100 WATS TO DIE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054290/b458316b248efeeece9b5498af42356d7a36b4cb.jpg"},{"name":"A QUARTER K","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054290/b458316b248efeeece9b5498af42356d7a36b4cb.jpg"},{"name":"WHY?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054290/b458316b248efeeece9b5498af42356d7a36b4cb.jpg"},{"name":"FRUITY FIFTY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054290/3938df0c8d904ef6677116f25f36fd3dbeafcd2d.jpg"},{"name":"FRUIT COLLECTOR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054290/3938df0c8d904ef6677116f25f36fd3dbeafcd2d.jpg"},{"name":"FRUIT ATTACK","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054290/3938df0c8d904ef6677116f25f36fd3dbeafcd2d.jpg"},{"name":"FRUIT HOARDER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054290/3938df0c8d904ef6677116f25f36fd3dbeafcd2d.jpg"},{"name":"FRUIT TYCOON","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054290/3938df0c8d904ef6677116f25f36fd3dbeafcd2d.jpg"},{"name":"ORCHARD OVERLORD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054290/3938df0c8d904ef6677116f25f36fd3dbeafcd2d.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://s